#: code:addons/whatsapp_coexistence/models/whatsapp_account.py:0
msgid ""
"The RC Studio license is missing. Set it on the account, or configure the "
"App Secret of your own Meta app."
msgstr ""
"La licence RC Studio est manquante. Renseignez-la sur le compte, ou "
"configurez l'App Secret de votre propre application Meta."

#. module: whatsapp_coexistence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:whatsapp_coexistence.field_whatsapp_account__wacoex_direct_callback_url
